<p>The Dragon Age Toolset is, with just a few omissions and changes, the same set of tools that was used internally at BioWare to develop the main Dragon Age: Origins campaign. It is a very powerful professional game development toolset and therefore some elements can take some time to master.
</p><p>This <strong class="selflink">overview of the toolset</strong> is intended as a general introduction to help put the later complexity into a simpler context.
</p>
